# Copied to out/.assetsignore by Next. Tells `wrangler deploy` (Workers Static
# Assets) which files to skip in the upload.
#
# The build emits two ONNX Runtime wasm binaries, both over Cloudflare's 25 MiB
# per-file asset limit and both loaded from a CDN at runtime instead:
#   * ~26 MB — the app's own onnxruntime-web (Demucs separation). Its CDN base
#     is set explicitly in lib/config.ts (ORT_WASM_BASE_URL).
#   * ~21 MB — the copy Transformers.js bundles (Whisper lyrics). Transformers.js
#     points onnxruntime-web at its own jsdelivr build by default, so it never
#     requests the bundled file either.
#
# Excluding them keeps the deploy under the limit; nothing requests a local copy.
_next/static/media/*.wasm
